<div n="1"><head>ACHTES KAPITEL<lb/>
STAAT</head><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
<cit><quote><hi rendition="#et">Methinks I see in my mind a noble and<lb/>
puissant <hi rendition="#g">nation</hi> rousing herself like a strong<lb/>
man after sleep, and shaking her invincible<lb/>
locks: methinks I see her as an eagle mewing<lb/>
her mighty youth, and kindling her undazzled<lb/>
eyes at the full midday beam; purging and<lb/>
unscaling her long-abused sight at the fountain<lb/>
itself of heavenly radiance; while the whole<lb/>
noise of timorous and flocking birds, with<lb/>
those also that love the twilight, flutter about,<lb/>
amazed at what she means, and in their<lb/>
